# Check text files out with LF on every platform.
#
# Without this, Git on Windows checks text out with CRLF. The skills'
# version hashes and .skill bundles are computed from the LF bytes, so
# on Windows every skill read as stale (five CI failures, Oct 2026).
# tests/integration/test_docs_match_code.py checks this file exists.
* text=auto eol=lf
